ion for loss of office</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/35">35.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/35"> Transfer of property etc </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/36">36.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/36">Directions</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/part/1/crossheading/alteration-of-the-councils-functions"><em>Alteration of the functions of Citizens Advice and Citizens Advice Scotland</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/37">37.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/37"> Extension of the functions of Citizens Advice and Citizens Advice Scotland </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/38">38.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/38">Removal of the Council's functions in relation to Northern Ireland</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/part/1/crossheading/representation-on-other-consumer-panels"><em>Representation on other consumer panels</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/39">39.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2007/17/section/39">The Financial Services Consumer Panel</a></span></p></li><li